      "source": "After setting up your server installation, you may want to configure settings such as the port or enable __TRILIUM_PH_0__TLS__TRILIUM_PH_1__. Configuration is managed via the Trilium __TRILIUM_PH_2__ file, which is located in the __TRILIUM_PH_3__data directory__TRILIUM_PH_4__ by default. To begin customizing your setup, copy the provided __TRILIUM_PH_5__ file with default values to __TRILIUM_PH_6__.",
